---
title: "Temporal VAE — Validation on Janssen Daily Wearable Data"
output: html_document
---

Generates synthetic versions of the daily Corsano data with the temporal VAE and checks them two ways:

1. **Utility (synthpop workflow, Raab, Nowok & Dibben):** `utility.gen()` with a CART propensity model
   (VAE vs synthpop's own `syn()` as a benchmark), `compare()` one-way, `utility.tables()` two-way,
   `utility.tab()` per variable, plus ECDF / KS. Run on patient-days and on a **patient-level summary table**
   (per-patient mean, SD, slope, visits) so the longitudinal structure is also tested.
2. **Transfer test:** the PART 4 daily spline model (`Model4WearablesV2_DailyMeans`) run on the real and the
   synthetic data, comparing BIC knot choice, bi-weekly emmeans, Non-Responder vs Responder contrasts and
   within-class change from baseline.

**Data changes (flagged):** `participant_id` is passed to the generator as `patient_id` and renamed back;
`sex_birth` and `on_any_steroid` are passed as factors (categorical) and converted back for the models.
Only the 7 key variables and the PART 4 covariates are used.

```{r setup, message=FALSE, warning=FALSE}
library(tidyverse)
library(keras3)
library(car)
library(nlme)
library(lme4)
library(splines)
library(emmeans)
library(synthpop)

main_rmd     <- "generate_synthetic_longitudinal_temporal_vae_v2.Rmd"                 # in the working directory
data_file    <- "H:/WearableBiologicsJJ/Data_for_Analysis/Daily_Final_DB_With_Response_Class.rda"
orig_results <- "H:/WearableBiologicsJJ/Daily_Estimates/Model_Results_DailyMeans.xlsx"  # PART 4 results
out_dir      <- "Janssen_Validation"
dir.create(out_dir, showWarnings = FALSE)

# Load the generator and validation functions (code of every chunk before the main file's test section)
rmd <- readLines(main_rmd)
rmd <- rmd[seq_len(grep("^```\\{r test-data", rmd)[1] - 1)]
chunk_starts <- grep("^```\\{r", rmd)
chunk_ends <- map_int(chunk_starts, ~ grep("^```\\s*$", rmd)[grep("^```\\s*$", rmd) > .x][1])
eval(parse(text = unlist(map2(chunk_starts, chunk_ends, ~ rmd[(.x + 1):(.y - 1)]))))

seeds <- 1:5
key_vars <- c("Core_Body_Temperature_daily", "Skin_Contact_Temperature_daily", "respiration_daily",
              "hrvAnalysis_sdnn_daily", "hrvAnalysis_rmssd_daily", "hrvAnalysis_min_hr_daily", "hrvAnalysis_mean_hr_daily")
covs <- c("age_at_enrollment", "sex_birth", "bmi", "on_any_steroid")
cond_vars <- c("resp_class_final", "sex_birth", "age_at_enrollment", "bmi")
max_days <- 98
```

